-- title:
--   Riemann's inequality for the function field of X₀(N) over ℚ̄
-- statement:
--   Let $N$ be a nonzero natural number and let $F_N =$ `modularFunctionFieldBar N` be the intermediate field of $\overline{\mathbb Q} \subseteq \mathrm{LaurentSeries}(\overline{\mathbb Q})$ obtained by base change: it is generated over $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ by the image, under the coefficientwise embedding of $\mathrm{LaurentSeries}(\mathbb Q)$ into $\mathrm{LaurentSeries}(\overline{\mathbb Q})$, of the subfield $\mathbb Q(\mathrm{divisorExpansions}\,N)$ of $\mathrm{LaurentSeries}(\mathbb Q)$ generated by the $q$-expansions attached to the divisors of $N$. A place of $F_N$ over $\overline{\mathbb Q}$ is, by definition, a valuation subring of $F_N$ that contains the image of $\overline{\mathbb Q}$, is not all of $F_N$, and is a principal ideal ring; a divisor is a finitely supported function from places to $\mathbb Z$. Let $D$ be such a divisor. Its degree is $\sum_v D(v)\,\deg v$, and the Riemann–Roch space $L(D)$ is the $\overline{\mathbb Q}$-submodule of those $f \in F_N$ with $v_{\mathrm{adic}}(f) \le \exp(D(v))$ in $\mathbb Z^{m0}$ for every place $v$. The assertion is the inequality in $\mathbb Z$
--   $$\deg D + 1 - g \;\le\; \dim_{\overline{\mathbb Q}} L(D),$$
--   where $g$ is `genusFF`, namely $\dim_{\overline{\mathbb Q}} H^1(0)$ for the zero divisor.
--
--   This is Riemann's inequality for the function field of $X_0(N)$ over $\overline{\mathbb Q}$, stated in the adelic currency (Riemann–Roch space and the genus defined as $\dim H^1(0)$) used by the height and specialisation theory on $J_0(N)$. It is cited when sections of a divisor with prescribed behaviour must be produced, for instance in the dimension estimates for spaces of modular forms of level $\Gamma_0(N)$ and in the construction of prolongation models and residue pairs on modular curves.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_degree_add_one_sub_genusFF_le_finrank_riemannRochSpace.lean

import Definitions.Def_ModularCurve_JZeroHeightForm
import Definitions.Def_AlgebraicCurve_RiemannRochRows

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

set_option autoImplicit false

open AlgebraicCurve ModularCurve

theorem ModularCurve.degree_add_one_sub_genusFF_le_finrank_riemannRochSpace (N : ℕ) [NeZero N]
    (D : Divisor (AlgebraicClosure ℚ) (modularFunctionFieldBar N)) :
    D.degree + 1 - (genusFF (AlgebraicClosure ℚ) (modularFunctionFieldBar N) : ℤ)
      ≤ (Module.finrank (AlgebraicClosure ℚ) ↥(riemannRochSpace D) : ℤ) := by sorry
